  "description": "`Smdn.Devices.US2066` is a .NET library for OLED character display modules which has [WiseChip US2066](https://www.wisechip.com.tw/) controller chip, based on [System.Device.Gpio and Iot.Device.Bindings](https://github.com/dotnet/iot).\nThis library supports OLED display module `SO1602A`, `SO2002A`, and other display modules can also be worked by deriving from the predefined base class.",
